<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="1a43d334">&lt;p&gt;
    If an action plan has not been developed, identify the following:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Activities, tasks, or work steps to be performed
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Deliverable, work product, component, or other output to be created, modified, or achieved
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Who is responsible for developing the output
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Who is responsible for reviewing it
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Associated quality and completion criteria
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Note the action items and the person responsible&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
